## Throne

::bg{location="throne" time="night"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The throne room is quiet. No current, no choir, no Regent. The crown waits where it always waited.
@quill{code="0010" when="entry.quillFirst.everRead"}: Go on. I held the rope for the last one. I'll hold it for you.
